      "title": "Linux link flags (-lrt -ldl -lpthread)",
      "category": "build",
      "base_severity": "low",
      "confidence": "verify",
      "why": "The QNX 8.0 pages for pthread_create(), dlopen() and timer_create() list libc as the library (\"usually included automatically\"); separate librt/libdl/libpthread are normally not needed.",
